
% Big Girls Don't Cry

a: I . . IV | . . . V |
ending_cadence: I . . IV | . . . V |
In: $a*2
Vr: $a*4
outro: $a*4
a_turnaround: I . . IV |
PCh: $a*3 $a_turnaround
b: IV | I | V |
bb: IV | I | V | vi |
Ch: $b $bb*2 $b
c: I | V | IV |
bridge_a: $c*4
d: V . . I | IV |
d_turnaround: IV |
bridge_b: $d*2 $d_turnaround
S: [G] $In $Vr $PCh $Ch $Vr $PCh $Ch $bridge_a $bridge_b $Ch $outro $ending_cadence
